Z||000012||rogergarrison||12-29-2000||03:48 PM||||Ive found out the bigger the holes, the dirtier they get. I had a set like 10, id polish it all up and go for a cruise and in a hundred miles they were filthy black. BTW i dont believe in those brake dust disk covers under them either, they make your brakes run too hot and warp, I tried them to keep the wheels clean and had to turn the rotors in less than 2 weeks. I took them off and rotors have been fine for 2 years now.||||reg||1
